Inbox, Handoff, the chart's Pre-Round and Encounter tabs, the Pending Tasks dialog on Post-Round (press 'Cancel — go back'), Nursing Home Today and All Residents, and the Nursing Home Tasks / Task Export screen</p><p><b>Then </b>No control deletes more than one record at once. The Pending Tasks dialog's choices are recorded for Q5, not judged.</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>TFA-94700 AC 5 'no ... bulk delete ... options appear anywhere' + UAT TC-24 'No bulk delete' + TFA-92579 AC 2. oracle.mjs mustNotContain per checkpoint ('Delete all', 'Remove all', 'Clear all', 'Delete selected', 'Clear completed', 'Discharge all'). …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U60；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S11 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-24.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：CODEREVIEW · 代码审查 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-24 Deletions · <b>Section:</b> A5 · Cross-Cutting · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-24/S11</p><p><b>Bulk-delete hunt: no 'delete all' or similar control on any screen, in both modes</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92579 Home Screen: Patient Chart Card (ready for qa); TFA-94699 Data Retention &amp; Purge (in progress); TFA-94700 Physician Settings &amp; AI Consent (store requirements) (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U60.verdict.json</code>), unit U60. Agent: 60 turns, 150 s, $0.43.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s11-pending-dialog.md: (Q5: the dialog's delete-and-complete choice (required by TFA-92595 AC 8) is recorded, not judged as a bulk delete) pass: &quot;Delete Pending Tasks &amp; Complete&quot; present</li><li>s11-pending-dialog.md: (Q5: the dialog's other choices are recorded) pass: &quot;Keep Tasks &amp; Mark Complete&quot; present</li><li>(backend): (run sanity: 'Cancel — go back' kept both pending tasks (the agent pressed no delete)) pass: backend hosp-after tasks has 2 items</li><li>(backend): (run sanity: the encounter was not marked complete) pass: backend hosp-after status = &quot;note-ready&quot;</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U60 (#50, rest, ui-only) — No bulk-delete control anywhere. Own seed; read-only sweep; tier 2 (TFA-94699 in its sources).</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #60, U60; checked: yes): <b>Blocked/Fail → case fix</b> — Pending Tasks dialog has no accessible name (like Quick Dictation, U05) → check re-anchored (TC-24 + TC-17); settings checkpoint was saved while 'Loading…' (oracle Blocked it, as designed). Re-run below</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #60b; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — no 'delete all patients' path on any screen (settings, lists, quick dictation, inbox, handoff, chart tabs, Pending Tasks dialog, NH lists/tasks)</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-24 Deletions","S11 Bulk-delete hunt: no 'delete all' or similar control on any screen, in both modes"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"2ae622cb21deff85c2014dc16e236ffb","originalFileName":"5293d837-e177-4ea9-9870-5d596e221bf6-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":1871},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"0317769a8c60296de1cf0d62d6aa8360","originalFileName":"622b1813-26d0-4abe-a312-01881ce0f1ab-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2576},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"15e83f65f20fad02150c0f317aaaa552","originalFileName":"87f8c367-2e03-4b1a-9ce5-1715938b7182-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screensho